Note on scope: this license covers the software (code, build configuration,
tests). It does not change the epistemic status of the scientific content —
see docs/design_document.md and docs/validation_plan.md for what is and
isn't established about the model's accuracy. "AS IS, WITHOUT WARRANTY" is
not merely legal boilerplate here: several parameters are explicitly
documented placeholders (see data/parameters/pathogens.yaml entries tagged
low_confidence), and the project has not undergone the operational
validation that would be required before informing real public-health
decisions.
